vice for more than 10 hours.","category":"Smoke Deficiencies","concept":"environment_life_safety","concept_label":"Environment & life safety"},"cms-k0711":{"code":"K-0711","title":"Provide a written emergency evacuation plan.","category":"Miscellaneous Deficiencies","concept":"environment_life_safety","concept_label":"Environment & life safety"},"cms-k0761":{"code":"K-0761","title":"To conduct inspection, testing and maintenance of fire doors by qualified individuals.","category":"Miscellaneous Deficiencies","concept":"environment_life_safety","concept_label":"Environment & life safety"},"cms-k0914":{"code":"K-0914","title":"Ensure receptacles at patient bed locations and where general anesthesia is administered, are tested after initial installation, replacement or servicing.","category":"Gas, Vacuum, and Electrical Systems Deficiencies","concept":"environment_life_safety","concept_label":"Environment & life safety"},"cms-k0918":{"code":"K-0918","title":"Have generator or other power source capable of supplying service within 10 seconds.","category":"Gas, Vacuum, and Electrical Systems Deficiencies","concept":"environment_life_safety","concept_label":"Environment & life safety"},"cms-f0625":{"code":"F-0625","title":"Notify the resident or the resident’s representative in writing how long the nursing home will hold the resident’s bed in cases of transfer to a hospital or therapeutic leave.","category":"Resident Rights Deficiencies","concept":"resident_rights","concept_label":"Resident rights & abuse/neglect"},"cms-f0801":{"code":"F-0801","title":"Employ sufficient staff with the appropriate competencies and skills sets to carry out the functions of the food and nutrition service, including a qualified dietician.","category":"Nutrition and Dietary Deficiencies","concept":"food_nutrition","concept_label":"Food, nutrition & hydration"},"cms-f0656":{"code":"F-0656","title":"Develop and implement a complete care plan that meets all the resident's needs, with timetables a